# railtech.uz — build-time environment (docs/ARCHITECTURE.md §6)

# Set to any value to build for the custom domain https://railtech.uz (base "/");
# without it the site is built for GitHub Pages under /rt-corporate-website.
# CUSTOM_DOMAIN=1

# The lead form endpoint, Cabinet links and the Telegram bot are NOT environment variables:
# they are edited in the CMS → «Компания» (src/data/cms/company.json).
